'''Covered in Webs''' is a [[debuff]] from several [[spider]] bosses.

==Sources==
* [[The Weaver]] (last for 8s, max 10 stacks)
* [[Arakaali, Spinner of Shadows]] (stacks, 8% penalty per stack for [[movement speed]])
* [[Sunken City Map|Armala, the Widow]] ?

==Other similar debuffs==
